        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-charities-and-not-for-profits-commission-act-2012-sec-2-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "62aa9c4a073a1d29d6a0629d3cbeb8296c4bbdbab77e87d37ecf7e5aaa81dc50",
      "skos:note": "Commencement of provision depends on Royal Assent and event in paragraph (b)"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-charities-and-not-for-profits-commission-act-2012#sec-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "2 Sections 5-15",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 19,
      "values:originalText": "to 300-5\nThe later of:\n(a) 1 October 2012; and\n(b) the day the Australian Charities and\nNot-for-profits Commission\n(Consequential and Transitional) Act\n2012 receives the Royal Assent.\nHowever, the provision(s) do not commence\nat all if the event mentioned in paragraph (b)\ndoes not occur."
    },
