      "dc:source": "australian-charities-and-not-for-profits-commission-act-2012.pdf, p.62",
      "values:originalText": "(3) The Commissioner may revoke the decision if satisfied that a\ncondition has not been complied with.\n\nResponsibilities of registered entities  Chapter 3\nRecord keeping and reporting  Part 3-2\nReporting  Division 60\nSection 60-95\nAustralian Charities and Not-for-profits Commission Act 2012\nCompilation date: 05/12/2025\nSubdivision 60-G—Collective and joint reporting\n60-95  Commissioner may approve collective or joint reporting by\nrelated entities\nJoint reporting",
      "skos:definition": "(3) The Commissioner may revoke the decision if satisfied that a\ncondition has not been complied with.\n\nResponsibilities of registered entities  Chapter 3\nRecord keeping and reporting  Part 3-2\nReporting  Division 60\nSection 60-95\nAustralian Charities and Not-for-profits Commission Act 2012\nCompilation date: 05/12/2025\nSubdivision 60-G—Collective and joint reporting\n60-95  Commissioner may approve collective or joint reporting by\nrelated entities\nJoint reporting",
