    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-charities-and-not-for-profits-commission-act-2012-sec-31-ss-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "31(2) December were a reference to the last day of the 6-month",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-charities-and-not-for-profits-commission-act-2012#sec-31-ss-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "australian-charities-and-not-for-profits-commission-act-2012.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "australian-charities-and-not-for-profits-commission-act-2012.pdf, p.62",
      "values:originalText": "(2) The Commissioner may allow a reporting group to prepare and\nlodge one or more information statements, or one or more single\ninformation statements and one or more single financial reports, in\nrelation to the reporting group for a financial year on a basis other\nthan an entity-by-entity basis.\nExample:\nThe Commissioner may allow a reporting group of affiliated\nregistered entities that advance religion and advance social or public\nwelfare to prepare and lodge 2 financial reports, one report in relation\nto the reporting group’s religious functions and one in relation to the\nreporting group’s welfare functions.\nApplication in approved form",
      "skos:definition": "(2) The Commissioner may allow a reporting group to prepare and\nlodge one or more information statements, or one or more single\ninformation statements and one or more single financial reports, in\nrelation to the reporting group for a financial year on a basis other\nthan an entity-by-entity basis.\nExample:\nThe Commissioner may allow a reporting group of affiliated\nregistered entities that advance religion and advance social or public\nwelfare to prepare and lodge 2 financial reports, one report in relation\nto the reporting group’s religious functions and one in relation to the\nreporting group’s welfare functions.\nApplication in approved form",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:australian-charities-and-not-for-profits-commission-act-2012-sec-31"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-charities-and-not-for-profits-commission-act-2012-sec-31-ss-2-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-charities-and-not-for-profits-commission-act-2012-sec-31-ss-2-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-charities-and-not-for-profits-commission-act-2012-sec-31-ss-2-logic-alleninterval-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "31aa6d9a5fee0bcd5c653515a8705dd1044527e9632163a122ad0db0651dfc14",
      "skos:note": "Commissioner allows reporting group to prepare and lodge financial reports on a basis other than entity-by-entity basis. Conditions may be imposed at any later time."
    },
    {
